                <Property name="foreground" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
                  <Color blue="ff" green="ff" red="ff" type="rgb"/>
                </Property>
                <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&#xa;Bareilly College Bareilly, was established in 1837. It was initially affiliated to Calcutta University  followed&#xa;by Allahabad and Agra Universities upto 1974. Since it is affiliated to MJP Rohilkhand University,Bareilly.&#xa;Bareilly College has always been on rock solid principles of high quality education,deep humility,outstanding &#xa;morals and inculcates a compassion for fellow human beings in the students. The institution bubbles with&#xa;energetic and high qualified faculty,receptive and eager students and a dedicated office staff with coherently&#xa;work together to build the solid frame work of the institution. It has an expansive campus and well equipped &#xa;research labotories and library which cater effectively to the needs of the students.&#xa;                                                                                        At Bareilly College we have a well-rounded educational experience&#xa;with both undergraduate and postgraduate classes in departments of Science, Commerce,Arts.B.Ed and Law.&#xa;We also have facilities of self-finance subjects, Biotechnology,Environmental Sciences,Geography and M.Ed.,&#xa;Home Science ,BBA,BCA,B.COM(Hons.),B.Lib.,M.Lib., I.Sc., etc and various diploma courses at our campus.&#xa;&#xa;The College provides the vocational courses. College has well qualified and competent faculties and staff to &#xa;carry out all these programs.&#xa;                     "/>
              </Properties>
            </Component>
          </SubComponents>
        </Container>
